        "original_id": "b4730932-e5d4-5a66-8e84-06b004dda16a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Karl Dönitz, Lutz Graf Schwerin von Krosigk, Adolf Hitler, Hans-Georg von Friedeburg\n- Organizations: Flensburg Government\n- Roles: Reichspräsident, Leading Minister, head of state of Germany, Generaladmiral\n- Events: dissolution of the Flensburg Government, suicide\n\nFacts:\n- Karl Dönitz briefly succeeded Adolf Hitler as the head of state of Germany.\n- The Flensburg Government was headed by Karl Dönitz as Reichspräsident and by Lutz Graf Schwerin von Krosigk as Leading Minister.\n- Hans-Georg von Friedeburg held the rank of Generaladmiral.\n- Hans-Georg von Friedeburg committed suicide shortly after the dissolution of the Flensburg Government.",
